Package: msidataset
Title: Mass Spectrometry Imaging Dataset Tools
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xiaoyu", "Xu", email = "XIAOYU021@e.ntu.edu.sg", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Xiaotao", "Shen", email = "xiaotao.shen@outlook.com", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9608-9964")))
Description: Analyze regional differences in mass spectrometry imaging data,
    reconstruct pseudo-tandem spectra from spatial ion images, and match those
    spectra to reference libraries. Retain ranked metabolite-feature candidates
    and their uncertainty, embed features using precomputed library vectors,
    and identify modules of related features. Build traceable evidence views
    with optional interpretation by a local language model. Process records and
    checkpoints support reproducible analysis.
